    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled in a quiet cul-de-sac in the heart of Arklow town, No. 14 Meadows Lane is a beautifully presented two-bedroom detached residence brought to the market in true walk-in condition. Extensively refurbished in 2024, the property has benefited from new plumbing, rewiring, new appliances, triple glazed windows and an internal 4-inch insulation wrap, resulting in an impressive B-rated BER. Ideally positioned within walking distance of shops, schools, restaurants, public transport links, and a host of local amenities, this home offers modern, energy-efficient living in a highly convenient town centre location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.74m x 5.93m\nUpon entering, you are welcomed into a bright and inviting kitchen and dining area finished with stylish herringbone flooring. The modern kitchen is fitted with attractive floor and wall units and comes complete with a range of brand-new appliances. This well-designed space is flooded with natural light.\n\nLiving Room - 4.74m x 3.13m\nThe living room is a cosy and comfortable space, ideal for relaxing or entertaining. Continuing the attractive herringbone flooring, the room is bright and well-proportioned, offering a warm and welcoming setting.\n\nLanding - 1.86m x 2.25m\nThe staircase leads to the first-floor accommodation, where two spacious double bedrooms and the bathroom are located.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.74m x 3.51m\nA spacious double bedroom benefiting from fitted wardrobes, providing excellent storage while maintaining a bright and airy feel.\n\nBathroom - 1.40m x 2.25m\nThe main bathroom has been finished to a high standard with fully tiled floors and walls. The suite comprises a walk-in shower, WC, WHB, and a contemporary double sink.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.74m x 3.13m\nBright and spacious double room with fitted wardrobes.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Detached two-bedroom residence</li><li> Presented in walk-in condition throughout</li><li> Fully refurbished in 2024</li><li> Oil fired central heating with new Combi boiler.</li><li> B-rated BER</li><li> Modern fitted kitchen with brand-new appliances</li><li> Herringbone flooring throughout ground floor accommodation</li><li> Quiet cul-de-sac setting with ample parking</li><li> Prime town centre location</li><li> Walking distance to shops, schools, restaurants, public transport and local amenities</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B\nBER No: 113041545\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 116.62"
      },
      {
